In article <AHOI.92Feb21001016@vipunen.hut.fi> ahoi@vipunen.hut.fi (Arto J Hoikkala) writes:
>How can I get say Excalibur +15?
This is possible, but it is very difficult.
You should start without an Excalibur in your game.
Take a bunch of darts.
Enchant darts with blessed scrolls of enchant weapon to +8.
Split darts in two groups. Enchant one group. When this succeeds you continue
with this group else with the other group. Repeat this until you have 1 dart.
Polymorph this super-dart into a long sword. Make her rustproof and dip her
into a fountain until she becomes an Excalibur. 

